__pycache__/
*.pyc
INFORME_AUDITORIA.md
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Preventive guards -------------------------------------------------------
# The system source code IS published, under code/ (MIT licence). The teaching
# corpus and the retrieval cache are deliberately NOT published (see README.md,
# "What is NOT included and why"). The rules below exist so that none of the
# withheld artefacts can be committed by accident.

# Retrieval cache: embeds verbatim passages of the copyrighted teaching corpus
retrieval_cache_*.json

# The teaching corpus itself, and any extracted plain text
*.pdf
*.txt
!code/requirements.txt
!code/requirements-inference.txt

# Model weights and adapters: the QLoRA adapter is fine-tuned on data derived
# from the copyrighted corpus, and is not part of this release
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin

# Working copies and backups: these have historically carried unredacted text
*_backup*
*.backup*
